===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|head=[[new|New]] [[world|World]] [[order|Order]]}}

# A [[vision]] for the world in which greater [[peace]] and [[stability]] is achieved through a new [[political]] order.
#* '''July 18 2012''', Scott Tobias, AV Club ''The Dark Knight Rises''[http://www.avclub.com/articles/the-dark-knight-rises-review-batman,82624/]
#*: Where the Joker preys on our fears of random, irrational acts of terror, Bane has an all-consuming, dictatorial agenda that’s more stable and permanent, a '''New World Order''' that’s been planned out with the precision of a military coup.
# According to [[conspiracy theory|conspiracy theories]], the planned rule of the world by a secret global [[elite]].

